WEBVTT

00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:03.940
<b>Salt</b>

00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:04.940
<b>Sugar</b>

00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:11.440
<b>Simmer Simmer</b>

00:00:16.380 --> 00:00:17.490
<i>Done!</i>

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:18.900
<i>This gyūdon is pretty legit.</i>

00:00:20.590 --> 00:00:22.320
<i>I hope it turned out well.</i>

00:00:22.330 --> 00:00:24.040
<b>Tasting</b>

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:30.500
So salty 
it's not 
even funny

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:33.380
<b>Salt</b>

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:33.380
<b>Sugar</b>

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:35.010
<b>Salt</b>

00:02:05.470 --> 00:02:09.980
<b>#09 
Bento</b>

00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:09.990
Sorry, bro.

00:02:09.990 --> 00:02:11.570
About dinner...

00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:12.630
<i>Oh.</i>

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:15.700
<i>He seems really busy lately.</i>

00:02:16.150 --> 00:02:17.960
<i>Even at home, he's working.</i>

00:02:19.630 --> 00:02:22.700
<i>When he's concentrating, 
he doesn't hear a thing.</i>

00:02:23.120 --> 00:02:24.490
Bro, bro.

00:02:25.650 --> 00:02:27.680
So, I made this gyūdon for dinner, but—

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:29.590
Thank you!

00:02:29.590 --> 00:02:30.960
Mind if I eat it here?

00:02:30.960 --> 00:02:31.550
Okay.

00:02:32.670 --> 00:02:33.990
Thanks for the food!

00:02:32.670 --> 00:02:34.350
Wait, there's...

00:02:34.670 --> 00:02:40.340
<b>Chew   Chew</b>

00:02:37.450 --> 00:02:38.630
<i>Is it okay?</i>

00:02:38.630 --> 00:02:40.340
What? It's good.

00:02:40.340 --> 00:02:43.510
<b>Chew</b>

00:02:40.710 --> 00:02:42.960
<i>There's no way it's okay.</i>

00:02:44.300 --> 00:02:46.760
So you're worried your older 
brother's working too hard?

00:02:46.760 --> 00:02:48.440
Yeah.

00:02:49.140 --> 00:02:50.840
What does he do?

00:02:50.840 --> 00:02:52.050
He works for some kind of agency.

00:02:52.050 --> 00:02:53.860
Sounds like he'd be busy.

00:02:54.260 --> 00:02:57.810
Lately, he's been working at home every day.

00:02:57.810 --> 00:02:59.770
It's just the two of you 
in the house, right?

00:02:59.770 --> 00:03:02.200
Yeah, he's letting me stay there.

00:03:02.710 --> 00:03:06.740
When he's concentrating, he doesn't 
worry about food or sleep.

00:03:07.410 --> 00:03:08.460
Yesterday...

00:03:08.450 --> 00:03:12.460
<b>Even when eating, 
his eyes don't
 leave the 
computer screen...</b>

00:03:08.720 --> 00:03:12.040
So... the salt and sugar...

00:03:13.020 --> 00:03:14.940
Huh? Did you say something?

00:03:14.940 --> 00:03:17.230
Nothing at all!

00:03:19.400 --> 00:03:22.060
I mean, he was so out of it that his 
tastebuds weren't working right.

00:03:22.670 --> 00:03:25.260
I swear, his body is going 
to fail sooner or later.

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:28.330
I'm sure your gyūdon
 didn't do him any favors.

00:03:28.740 --> 00:03:31.010
Did you eat the gyūdon, too?

00:03:31.770 --> 00:03:33.150
I couldn't do it...

00:03:34.450 --> 00:03:37.220
It <i>looked</i> perfect, though.

00:03:37.440 --> 00:03:39.330
I guess you do worry sometimes, too.

00:03:39.330 --> 00:03:40.930
Yeah, you're usually positive.

00:03:41.310 --> 00:03:43.900
Hey, I do think a lot about of stuff, too.

00:03:43.910 --> 00:03:45.120
<b>Swoon</b>

00:03:45.120 --> 00:03:47.950
<b>Pet   Pet</b>

00:03:45.990 --> 00:03:46.960
Why?

00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:47.950
Reasons.

00:03:48.340 --> 00:03:50.690
Look at you, though! Cooking?

00:03:50.690 --> 00:03:52.050
That's really impressive!

00:03:52.050 --> 00:03:53.850
I'm really bad at it, though.

00:03:53.850 --> 00:03:57.090
Sometimes, my boss at 
work will teach me a bit.

00:03:57.090 --> 00:03:58.010
What?

00:03:58.010 --> 00:04:00.160
You want to learn how to cook?

00:04:00.160 --> 00:04:02.190
Yes, I guess.

00:04:02.190 --> 00:04:04.210
And who are you cooking for?

00:04:04.850 --> 00:04:06.930
Uh, for my big brother.

00:04:06.930 --> 00:04:07.960
Your big brother?

00:04:08.280 --> 00:04:10.170
He always seems so busy,

00:04:10.170 --> 00:04:11.940
so I want to be able to help him out a bit.

00:04:11.940 --> 00:04:13.330
That's so nice!

00:04:13.330 --> 00:04:16.060
I wish Shun would think of me that way.

00:04:16.470 --> 00:04:18.750
You leave it to me!

00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:22.280
My brother takes care of the rent 
and a bunch of other stuff.

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:25.500
I figured I should at least 
learn how to do some housework.

00:04:25.500 --> 00:04:27.780
So that's why I started to cook.

00:04:29.090 --> 00:04:29.740
What's wrong?

00:04:30.010 --> 00:04:32.840
It's funny that I mixed up 
the salt and the sugar.

00:04:32.840 --> 00:04:34.020
That's just too cliche.

00:04:34.410 --> 00:04:36.460
You cracked up with such a delay...

00:04:36.730 --> 00:04:41.570
But if he's so busy, is he 
even eating anything at work?

00:04:41.570 --> 00:04:42.920
Oh, right!

00:04:42.920 --> 00:04:46.130
Oh, maybe you should make him a bento, then.

00:04:46.830 --> 00:04:48.100
A bento...

00:04:48.280 --> 00:04:50.660
But with your cooking skills...

00:04:50.660 --> 00:04:51.890
I think it's fine.

00:04:51.890 --> 00:04:54.670
He did eat Shiki's failed gyūdon.

00:04:54.670 --> 00:04:55.300
You're mean!

00:04:55.600 --> 00:04:56.360
It's true, though.

00:04:56.360 --> 00:04:59.940
Since my brother's sense of taste is 
messed up, this is my time to practice.

00:05:00.430 --> 00:05:01.260
Yeah.

00:05:01.260 --> 00:05:03.660
Just don't take his life.

00:05:05.010 --> 00:05:07.630
Senpai, about yesterday's meeting.

00:05:07.630 --> 00:05:09.330
Sorry, but you'll have to tell me later.

00:05:09.760 --> 00:05:11.040
I understand.

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:12.140
Yes.

00:05:12.140 --> 00:05:14.490
If the task we're working 
on right now is finished,

00:05:14.260 --> 00:05:16.470
<i>He seems so busy lately.</i>

00:05:14.490 --> 00:05:16.430
we can assign someone right away.

00:05:16.430 --> 00:05:19.330
In the meantime, getting the 
manual ready for sharing...

00:05:16.470 --> 00:05:18.670
<i>I feel like he never takes any breaks,</i>

00:05:18.670 --> 00:05:21.080
<i>so it's impressive that there's no 
sign of exhaustion on his face.</i>

00:05:21.590 --> 00:05:23.970
I mean, you've been tired lately, right?

00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:26.530
<i>He's mindful of others,</i>

00:05:26.980 --> 00:05:29.220
<i>but neglectful of himself.</i>

00:05:30.540 --> 00:05:33.280
<i>Is there anything I can do for him?</i>

00:05:33.810 --> 00:05:36.020
<b>Twist Effect</b>

00:05:33.810 --> 00:05:36.020
Ideal softness like a rubber baseball

00:05:33.810 --> 00:05:36.020
Perfect fit

00:05:33.810 --> 00:05:36.020
Neck pressure point

00:05:33.810 --> 00:05:36.020
<b>Relieves hip soreness!</b>

00:05:36.340 --> 00:05:38.890
<i>A physical gift might only cause him trouble.</i>

00:05:38.890 --> 00:05:41.970
<i>Besides, I'm clueless, so
I wouldn't know what to get.</i>

00:05:42.560 --> 00:05:45.080
<i>Ideally, I could help with his work.</i>

00:05:47.140 --> 00:05:48.820
<i>I recognize that hair.</i>

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:51.620
<b>Hazy  Hazy</b>

00:05:49.970 --> 00:05:51.610
<i>An acquaintance?</i>

00:05:52.100 --> 00:05:56.510
<i>But Hayate-kun is the only person 
I know who is that young.</i>

00:06:00.130 --> 00:06:01.070
Excuse me.

00:06:00.130 --> 00:06:02.540
<b>Walk  Walk</b>

00:06:01.070 --> 00:06:02.070
<i>He's coming over here.</i>

00:06:02.070 --> 00:06:02.700
Yes?

00:06:03.190 --> 00:06:05.260
<i>I can't remember who this 
is for the life of me.</i>

00:06:05.950 --> 00:06:08.380
Where are the bento boxes?

00:06:11.580 --> 00:06:13.560
They are over there... probably.

00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:15.280
Thank you.

00:06:15.280 --> 00:06:18.510
<i>So apparently, we're close enough
 to start talking just like that.</i>

00:06:19.230 --> 00:06:20.130
<i>Who is this?</i>

00:06:20.130 --> 00:06:22.160
<i>What a cool store employee.</i>

00:06:23.350 --> 00:06:25.350
Are you looking for something for yourself?

00:06:25.350 --> 00:06:26.610
No, for my older brother.

00:06:27.010 --> 00:06:29.110
Should I get one for myself, too?

00:06:29.110 --> 00:06:29.860
<i>Older brother?</i>

00:06:29.860 --> 00:06:31.320
<b>Clear!</b>

00:06:29.860 --> 00:06:31.320
<b>Clear!</b>

00:06:30.930 --> 00:06:32.690
Thank you so much!

00:06:32.950 --> 00:06:36.990
By any chance, are you Senpai's—
Souta-san's—younger brother?

00:06:36.990 --> 00:06:38.450
How did you know?

00:06:38.450 --> 00:06:40.320
Are you some kind of psychic store clerk?

00:06:40.320 --> 00:06:42.440
Uh, I am neither of those things.

00:06:42.440 --> 00:06:43.720
I'm just a regular Mima.

00:06:45.150 --> 00:06:46.300
Are you all right?

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:47.730
I am.

00:06:47.730 --> 00:06:49.140
I really do apologize.

00:06:49.390 --> 00:06:52.550
I'm sorry I didn't put it together.

00:06:52.550 --> 00:06:54.720
It was dark that night,

00:06:54.720 --> 00:06:56.490
and you had glasses the other day.

00:06:56.490 --> 00:07:02.100
No, if anything, it's my fault for not 
remembering a person as distinct as you.

00:07:02.430 --> 00:07:04.630
You're buying your older 
brother a bento box?

00:07:04.630 --> 00:07:05.260
Yes.

00:07:05.740 --> 00:07:07.780
I was thinking of making him a bento.

00:07:08.600 --> 00:07:10.730
He's been so busy lately,

00:07:10.730 --> 00:07:13.100
I don't want him to neglect eating lunch.

00:07:13.100 --> 00:07:14.260
I see.

00:07:14.680 --> 00:07:18.320
<i>I remember now that he just 
has jellied drinks when he's busy.</i>

00:07:15.450 --> 00:07:15.910
<b>Slurp</b>

00:07:18.840 --> 00:07:22.430
I can imagine he's not eating proper meals.

00:07:22.430 --> 00:07:26.050
I think you might be right about that.

00:07:26.050 --> 00:07:27.060
I knew it.

00:07:27.750 --> 00:07:29.460
<i>They're a lot alike.</i>

00:07:30.150 --> 00:07:32.690
If you buy a two-set, it's cheaper.

00:07:33.340 --> 00:07:35.510
They would match, but I guess that's okay.

00:07:35.860 --> 00:07:37.250
My little brother.

00:07:37.250 --> 00:07:39.260
One of my comforts.

00:07:40.540 --> 00:07:44.860
<i>Maybe I'm not needed this time around.</i>

00:07:47.590 --> 00:07:49.440
Good luck with the bento.

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:51.640
I'm sure it'll make Souta-san very happy.

00:07:52.370 --> 00:07:53.300
Yes.

00:07:54.020 --> 00:07:55.100
<i>I'll do my best.</i>

00:07:57.610 --> 00:08:00.280
<i>I'm so damn tired.</i>

00:08:02.020 --> 00:08:04.310
<i>My exhaustion is catching up to me.</i>

00:08:04.660 --> 00:08:06.640
<i>Huh? What's that?</i>

00:08:07.650 --> 00:08:08.600
Souma?

00:08:08.600 --> 00:08:10.220
Good morning.

00:08:11.000 --> 00:08:12.710
I tried my hand at making you bento

00:08:13.530 --> 00:08:15.630
Huh? A bento?

00:08:16.560 --> 00:08:18.720
Shiki-san, is that a bento?

00:08:18.720 --> 00:08:19.880
It sure is.

00:08:19.880 --> 00:08:21.970
Even though your meals 
were so slapdash lately?

00:08:21.970 --> 00:08:24.190
Did you get a girlfriend?

00:08:24.100 --> 00:08:26.060
<b>Doesn't deny
 it on purpose</b>

00:08:24.190 --> 00:08:25.500
I knew it, I knew it!

00:08:25.500 --> 00:08:28.010
I mean I've been suspecting it, sort of!

00:08:26.270 --> 00:08:29.550
<i>I've been so busy lately, even at home.</i>

00:08:28.010 --> 00:08:30.630
Remember when we went drinking together?

00:08:29.550 --> 00:08:33.000
<i>Maybe I made him worry, 
since he's so empathetic.</i>

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:36.930
<i>I guess he's worked hard to get 
to the bento-making level.</i>

00:08:40.430 --> 00:08:42.700
He really is the best.

00:08:45.160 --> 00:08:46.530
Good job!

00:08:46.530 --> 00:08:47.900
You really made one!

00:08:47.900 --> 00:08:48.540
I did.

00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:49.540
I made one for myself while I was at it.

00:08:49.810 --> 00:08:51.520
You kept your promise.

00:08:51.520 --> 00:08:53.210
I picked out the boxes, too.

00:08:53.460 --> 00:08:55.260
Oh wow, so a matching set?

00:08:55.260 --> 00:08:56.430
Only the color of the band differs.

00:08:57.420 --> 00:08:59.700
They happened to be cheaper as a set.

00:08:59.700 --> 00:09:01.660
You two seem really close.

00:09:01.660 --> 00:09:03.620
I'm sure you made him really happy.

00:09:03.620 --> 00:09:05.680
I think I'll keep doing 
this from time to time.

00:09:05.680 --> 00:09:06.430
That's great.

00:09:06.430 --> 00:09:08.450
Maybe I'll step up my cooking game too.

00:09:11.230 --> 00:09:12.690
<b>RICE!!</b>

00:09:11.230 --> 00:09:12.690
<b>RICE!!</b>

00:09:12.740 --> 00:09:14.240
Riiice!!

00:09:13.020 --> 00:09:14.220
Riiice!!

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:16.320
<b>Bro

00:09:18.030 --> 00:09:19.580
<b>Bro</b>

00:09:18.030 --> 00:09:19.580
<b>Thanx!</b>

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:19.440
Thanx!

00:09:19.790 --> 00:09:21.740
<b>Bro</b>

00:09:20.280 --> 00:09:21.740
<b>Bro</b>

00:09:20.280 --> 00:09:21.740
<b>LOL</b>

00:09:20.320 --> 00:09:21.470
LOL

00:09:23.450 --> 00:09:24.950
<i>Sorry, bro.</i>

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:29.960
Hum hum

00:09:25.190 --> 00:09:27.430
<i>Gonna go buy some white rice.</i>

00:09:27.430 --> 00:09:29.950
<i>You really can't tell when he's tired.</i>

00:10:59.970 --> 00:11:04.970
<b>Coming up next</b>

00:10:59.970 --> 00:11:04.970
<b>Day Off</b>

00:11:04.980 --> 00:11:10.010
<b>We hope you'll tune in again!</b>

